# Copy to .env.local.
#
# Leave API_URL empty to run every screen on the built-in mock data (src/lib/api/mock),
# including demo sign-in (password Bovas@2026 for the accounts listed on the sign-in page).
# Set it to the PHP API to use live data, e.g. http://localhost:8000 when running
# `composer serve` in bovas-api. Only the phases the API implements go live (API_PHASE in
# src/lib/api/client.ts); later screens keep using mock data.
API_URL=
